          <p>My recent work includes a <strong>clinic EHR prototype</strong> for patient records, scheduling and QR queues, and <strong>Kim Flower Shop</strong>, an Astro storefront with a Sanity-managed catalog. I use <strong>Docker, GitHub Actions and CI/CD</strong> to make projects easier to build, test and deliver.</p>
